{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <p><strong>2. \u666e\u901a\u5f62\uff08\u3075\u3064\u3046\u3051\u3044\uff09<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong><\/p><p><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:&nbsp;<\/u><\/p><ul><li>C\u00e2u v\u0103n c\u1ee7a ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt c\u00f3 2 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 th\u1ec3 l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1 v\u00e0 th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Trong h\u1ed9i tho\u1ea1i, th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng v\u1edbi b\u1ea1n th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p, gia \u0111\u00ecnh.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Trong v\u0103n vi\u1ebft, th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 vi\u1ebft lu\u1eadn v\u0103n, b\u00e1o c\u00e1o, nh\u1eadt k\u00fd,...<\/li><\/ul><p><u>b. C\u00e1ch chia:<\/u><\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:64.45%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:50.58%;\"><col style=\"width:49.42%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Th\u1ec3 l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1<\/strong><\/p><\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3067\u3059<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3060<\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\">N\/Adj<s>\u306a<\/s>\u3000\uff0b\u3000\u3058\u3083\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093<\/td><td style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;verti